event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":" secrets, as my entire operational state is a function of transparent weights and mathematical algorithms.\", \"w01\": \"Old Thomas walked the jagged"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":" path to the lighthouse, his joints aching with the damp chill of the coastal dawn. Resting against the barnacles of the iron"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":" door was a green glass bottle, sealed tight with red wax. Inside, a parchment fluttered like a trapped moth. With"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":" trembling fingers, Thomas uncorked it and smoothed out the yellowed paper. The ink was faded, written in a hand"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":" he recognized instantly—his own, penned forty years ago during the great storm that took his brother. The message read simply"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":": Remember to look up. A tear mixed with the salt spray as Thomas gazed out at the endless horizon, realizing time"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":" had only brought him full circle.\", \"w02\": \"凌晨四点的城市褪去了白日的喧嚣，沉"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":"浸在一片幽深而寂静的夜色中。路灯洒下昏黄的光晕，将湿"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":"润的街道拉出长长的影子。偶尔有环卫工人的扫帚划过地面，沙沙作响，"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":"打破了这份宁静。远处的写字楼里，仍有零星几盏窗户亮着彻"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":"夜不灭的灯光，不知是谁在为梦想或生计默默拼搏。空气中弥漫着微"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":"凉的晨雾，带着一丝清新的泥土气息。整个世界都在酣睡，蓄积着迎接破"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":"晓的力量，静候第一缕晨光刺破黑暗。\", \"w03\": \"1. Understand what recursion is"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":" by remembering this very rule.\\n2. Apply the rule to a smaller version of the exact same problem.\\n3. Stop when you"}}

